{"parse": {"title": "间隔月-01", "pageid": 101215, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%B7%E5%91%A8%E5%85%AD%C2%B7%E9%97%B4%E9%9A%94%E6%9C%88\" title=\"冷周六·间隔月\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">间隔月-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%97%B4%E9%9A%94%E6%9C%88-02\" title=\"间隔月-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">间隔月</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.8D.E9.80.9F.E4.B9.8B.E5.AE.A2\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"不速之客\">不速之客</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 不速之客</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Long Winter</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lapulasidatang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lapulasidatang\"><img alt=\"lapulasidatang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-lapulasidatang.png/600px-Cg-lapulasidatang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-lapulasidatang.png/900px-Cg-lapulasidatang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-lapulasidatang.png/1200px-Cg-lapulasidatang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你在这儿，正好我有很重要的事要告诉你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我的调任申请终于通过了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>郑重的宣告并没有引起设想中的反应，但冷周六的兴奋让她有些顾不上对方眼中的困惑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>这真是我今天听到最好的消息了，我还以为他们要过三五个月才会回复我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>幸好我没有拖到几个月后才开始整理手头的工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你怎么看起来脸色不太好？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lapulasidatang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lapulasidatang2\"><img alt=\"lapulasidatang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/600px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/900px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/1200px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>你……你是说，你要离开我们的项目了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>别担心，我会处理好的，不会对后续研究有任何……影响？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看到同事脸上越发密布的阴云，善解人意的蛇发女妖立刻提出了优化方案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>三天我就能把所有这些都干完。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我甚至可以把车票改早两天？得赶在他们下班前……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>就……非得这样吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>即便早已习惯同事浮夸的语言风格，当听到对方尾音中的哽咽时，冷周六还是愣了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>三天已经很紧张了，毕竟我还得抽时间给我的生态缸包好缓冲材料……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>好吧，你说了算——你能接受的最长交接时间是多久？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>如果……如果我们的相处有什么问题的话，你明明可以早点告诉我啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>有……什么问题？我们相处得不是很愉快吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>上个月发的那篇论文我们甚至是并列一作。在拉普拉斯，难道还会有比这更坚不可破的友谊吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>我不明白，亲爱的。既然没有任何问题和不快，为什么你这么突然地就要向我告别？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>因为我找到了更想做的项目！我得说这个方向真是太棒了，所以我才想第一时间告诉你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>亲爱的，你……啊！我的言语为何如此无力，我心中的悲伤又该如何倾倒？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>呃……你不为我高兴吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那双竖瞳中的真挚和不解，让悲痛中的绿棱镜陷入了短暂的自我怀疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>难道……她真的只是想分享一个好消息？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>这听起来确实让人难以接受……您当时一定难过极了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>岂止是难过！简直像有人在寒冷的冬夜拉开我的大衣领子，用铲子往我脖子里不停铲雪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>想开点，指望她细致体会同事的心情，还不如直接多分点工作给她，至少那是她擅长的部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>话虽如此，一直合作得很愉快的同事忽然告诉你她要离开——她甚至已经办好了手续！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>天哪，这实在是太冷酷了，我没法不觉得惊讶和难过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一旁的库珀花环忍不住点了点头，几乎要为自己也有可能遭遇这样的“抛弃”而提前感到难过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>是冷周六的话，我可不会惊讶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>毕竟她就是那种人。如果现在马里亚纳海沟里突然有了个她感兴趣的项目，她也会立刻兴高采烈地戴上潜水头盔跳下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>她考虑了你的情绪，但选错了运算模型。这样说能安慰到你吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>噢，谢谢你，亲爱的。但我得说……她在工作上可不会出这种错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>好像听到有人在叫我，所以我及时醒了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>昨晚那批分析报告可真够折腾人……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在普列谢茨克遇到一个不眼熟的人可不容易，何况对方看起来并不全然陌生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>是……拉普拉斯送材料的人来了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>噢，亲爱的西尔维！我冷酷的小黄瓜，我们有多久没见了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个热情的拥抱，换来的是睡眠不足的研究员露出思索的神情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>……西尔维？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>确实很久没见，你说话的风格倒是没变……呃……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>糟糕，记忆被时间锈蚀了。她努力试图吐出一个名字——熟悉的，就在嘴边的，前同事的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>天哪！你该不会……不记得我了吧？这可太过分了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>当然不，毕竟在我来普列谢茨克之前我们还在一起共事，只是你的名字……它已经在我嘴边了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>……再给我一点时间，我真的马上就能想起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>幸好有蛇比她抢先一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅷ：</div><div>西蒙娜，我最最亲爱的、博学的、浪漫的朋友！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅷ：</div><div>但愿你在实验的间隙抽空读完了《看不见的河流》，我已经迫不及待想跟你讨论它了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六发间的小蛇探长了身子，温柔地缠上访客的手腕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>真感谢你，艾斯黛乐。我现在觉得好多了，没有你我可该怎么办呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>西蒙娜……？噢，当然，西蒙娜。再见到你真是太好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>我真不知道该说你什么才好了，我冷酷的小黄瓜——看看，我甚至好好地记着你的小名——亏我还以为咱们是最好的朋友呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>我明明是你到拉普拉斯总部之后认识的第一个人，我们一起做了你在总部第一个项目，我甚至千里迢迢跑来北极圈见你！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>可你——你居然根本不记得我的名字！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "间隔月-01"}}